{"strings": [
{"key": "data.lesson.first_market.say.1", "text": "絞って買って。新しい店の広い棚は、眠ってるお金でしかない。", "src": "Buy narrow. A wide shelf on a new bar is just money standing still."},
{"key": "data.lesson.first_night.say.0", "text": "ボトル8本に樽ひとつ。一応、これもバーね。", "src": "Eight bottles and a keg. That is a bar, technically."},
{"key": "data.lesson.first_night.say.1", "text": "注ぐ前にお客を読んで — 何しに来たかはIDカードに書いてある。", "src": "Read them before you pour — the licence says what they came for."},
{"key": "data.lesson.red_night.say.0", "text": "レジが家賃に届かない。どの店も一度はそうなる。", "src": "The till is under the rent. It happens to every room once."},
{"key": "data.lesson.red_night.say.1", "text": "二度なら癖。三度目は、もう別の店の話。", "src": "Twice is a habit. Three times is a different bar with your name on it."},
{"key": "data.lesson.two_spirits.say.0", "text": "シェイカーにスピリッツ2種類。放っておいてもドリンクにはならない。", "src": "Two spirits in one tin do not become a drink on their own."},
{"key": "data.lesson.two_spirits.say.1", "text": "シェイクかステア。どっちかはレシピ帳に書いてある。", "src": "Shake it or stir it. The book says which."},
{"key": "data.story.ece_1.ask.0", "text": "もう閉店。うちに実際あるもので、一杯ちょうだい。", "src": "Door is shut. Pour me one of whatever we actually have."},
{"key": "data.story.ece_1.ask.1", "text": "オーナーの最初の夜だもの。どこかにそういう決まりがあるの。", "src": "Owner's first night. It is a rule somewhere."},
{"key": "data.story.ece_1.declined.0", "text": "バーテンダーの頼みを断るなんて。大胆ね。", "src": "You are turning down the bartender. Bold."},
{"key": "data.story.ece_1.nudge.0", "text": "棚のものなら何でもいい。私は面倒な客じゃないから。", "src": "Anything on that shelf. I am not the difficult one."},
{"key": "data.story.ece_1.served_right.0", "text": "先週まで無かった店にしては、悪くない。", "src": "Not bad for a room that did not exist last week."},
{"key": "data.story.ece_1.served_right.1", "text": "この後のお客は秒数を数えるよ。私は数えないけど。", "src": "The ones who come after me will count your seconds. I do not."},
{"key": "data.story.ece_1.served_wrong.0", "text": "頼んだのと違う。しかも私は甘いほうなのに。", "src": "That is not what I asked for, and I am the easy one."},
{"key": "hud.closed.banner", "text": "閉店しました\n3日続けて赤字 — 「最初から」でもう一度", "src": "THE BAR IS CLOSED\nthree days losing money — NEW RUN to try again"},
